    "description": "The Rideshare Rides History API provides a comprehensive overview of past rides within the rideshare service, enabling users to access historical ride data efficiently. This endpoint allows consumers, such as application developers and business analysts, to retrieve detailed information about completed rides, including timestamps, route details, and fare summaries. Typical use cases include generating reports, analyzing ride patterns, and improving customer service experiences. By leveraging this API, organizations can enhance their operational insights and decision-making processes related to rideshare activities.",
